Bring in "sys" as sys.
Bring in "net" as net.

Note: The Sentinel v0.9.5 - Entity-driven file management.

Define an Entity called ArchiveJob:
    Set file_path to "".
    Set priority to "Normal".

Define an action called process_job taking task:
    Print "Processing " and file_path of task.
    Move file_path of task to "Archive/".

List files in "." as files.
For each f in files:
    If f ends with ".zip":
        Create an ArchiveJob called current_task.
        Set file_path of current_task to f.
        Run process_job taking current_task in the background.
